<title>RUSSIA: WEATHER - Conditions at CIS airports - October 28.</title>
<headline>WEATHER - Conditions at CIS airports - October 28.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Strong winds and wet snow may force the Magadan international airport in Russia's Far East to close on October 29, the State Weather Service said on Monday.</p>
<p>It said that the probability of closure was 90 percent.</p>
<p>Airports on the Kamchatka Peninsula may close on October 31 due to winds and snow.</p>
<p>-- Moscow Newsroom +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
